#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/transverse-field-ising-model/extracted-outputs/d4902d14-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/transverse-field-ising-model/extracted-outputs/d4902d14-0.avif)\n"

